[{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01250000_03_0010","text":"————想把舞台做到最好"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01250000_03_0020","text":"不然的话……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01250000_03_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01250000_03_0030","text":"来打造吧，最好的舞台"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01250000_03_0029","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01250000_03_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01250000_03_0032","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01250000_03_0033","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01250000_03_0034","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01250000_03_0035","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01250000_03_0036","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01250000_03_0040","text":"那首曲子……\n之前，在街上听到过……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01250000_03_0000","text":"钢琴学生的家长1"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01250000_03_0050","text":"真是非常美妙的门德尔松……！\n绯田小姐在学员里可是最棒的呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01250000_03_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01250000_03_0060","text":"哈哈……确实弹得很好"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01250000_03_0070","text":"能弹这首曲子的人……\n数不胜数"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01250000_03_0080","text":"但是————"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01250000_03_0001","text":"主持人"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01250000_03_0090","text":"冠军是————"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01250000_03_0000","text":"钢琴学生的家长1"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01250000_03_0100","text":"绯田小姐家的那位小姑娘\n也很出色呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01250000_03_0002","text":"钢琴学生的家长2"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01250000_03_0110","text":"是啊\n但是————"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01250000_03_0002","text":"钢琴学生的家长2"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01250000_03_0120","text":"但是，绯田小姐一直都很厉害嘛……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01250000_03_0121","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01250000_03_0130","text":"——能不能打动人心，就不知道了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01250000_03_0140","text":"美琴……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01250000_03_0143","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s02_01250000_03_0150","text":"我不想妥协"}]
